OL,3,AKilling of six people in Krakow square
OL,4,A'constitutes terrorist offence', says
OL,5,APolish prosecutor
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice are continuing to investigate
OL,8,Fafter six people were killed in a
OL,9,Fshooting in Krakow's market square -
OL,10,Fwhat we know so far
OL,12,FSixteen more were injured, including
OL,13,Ftwo police officers, five foreign
OL,14,Fnationals and the suspect. Two of those
OL,15,Finjured have now left hospital and
OL,16,Fothers are in stable condition, police
OL,17,Fsay
OL,19,FThree other bodies were found at the
OL,20,Fsuspect's home, and were later
OL,21,Fidentified as the man's parents and
OL,22,Fsister
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
